  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS-UNAMA Salaam Support Group II Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement is for Norwegian support to the UNAMA Salaam Support Group project. The intended project outcome is to contribute to UNAMA&apos;s efforts in developing the capacity and performance of the High Peace Council / Salaam Support Group in implementing reconciliation activities across country and assist the Government and the people of Afghanistan in laying foundations for sustainable peace and development,</narrative>
  </description>
